      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BANDIT LYNNE (1) boasts a strong record this journey here with five wins and five minors from 12 tries. Was out of the placings last time (30.16) at Nowra in a NG, finishing fifth and beaten 12 lengths. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. FEDERAL SNIPER (5) has a superb record at this trip, unbeaten so far from three starts. Scored by 5 lengths last time (29.49) in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track. Can feature with the right run. BANDIT ALEX (4) struggled in tougher grade last start after losing his position early at Nowra, but prior to that won by 2 lengths at Nowra (29.62) beating Condo Bandit in a NG on August 19. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ZIPPING ALADDIN (8) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
